          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 53:13",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 53,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, as they were about to take their weapons of war, they were overpowered by the persuasions of Helaman and his brethren, for they were about to break the oath which they had made.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 154,
            "end": 159,
            "text": "Num. 30:2."
          },
          {
            "start": 164,
            "end": 168,
